{"id":"84785d7ea3ad1a08","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-cantor-compactness.md","title":"Cantor 紧致性","display":"thm-cantor-compactness — Cantor 紧致性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-cantor-compactness","aliases":["20-thm-cantor-compactness"],"display":"thm-cantor-compactness — Cantor 紧致性","chapter":"8","section":"8.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 8.3.1","source_pdf_pages":[201],"source_printed_pages":[168],"depends_on":["[[20-df-cantor-space]]","[[20-df-closed-class]]","[[20-thm-konig]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-cantor-compactness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-cantor-compactness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cantor-compactness — Cantor 紧致性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"8"},{"key":"section","html":"8.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 8.3.1"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>201</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>168</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef101d71722ee067\" href=\"?note=ef101d71722ee067\" title=\"20-df-cantor-space\">20-df-cantor-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b4c1ab1358773e54\" href=\"?note=b4c1ab1358773e54\" title=\"20-thm-konig\">20-thm-konig</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(C\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span> 闭；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 为指标集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(U_i)_{i\\in I}\">\\((U_i)_{i\\in I}\\)</span> 为 Cantor 空间中的开集族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\">\\((C_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\\)</span> 为 Cantor 空间子集序列。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ef101d71722ee067\" href=\"?note=ef101d71722ee067\" title=\"20-df-cantor-space\">20-df-cantor-space</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b4c1ab1358773e54\" href=\"?note=b4c1ab1358773e54\" title=\"20-thm-konig\">20-thm-konig</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nC\\subseteq\\bigcup_{i\\in I}U_i\\Rightarrow\n\\exists F\\subseteq I\\ [|F|&lt;\\omega\\land C\\subseteq\\bigcup_{i\\in F}U_i],\\\\\n(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ C_{n+1}\\subseteq C_n)\\land\n(\\forall n\\ C_n\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\operatorname{Closed}(C_n))\n\\Rightarrow\\bigcap_nC_n\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nC\\subseteq\\bigcup_{i\\in I}U_i\\Rightarrow\n\\exists F\\subseteq I\\ [|F|&lt;\\omega\\land C\\subseteq\\bigcup_{i\\in F}U_i],\\\\\n(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ C_{n+1}\\subseteq C_n)\\land\n(\\forall n\\ C_n\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\operatorname{Closed}(C_n))\n\\Rightarrow\\bigcap_nC_n\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先证明全空间覆盖版本。把每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_i\">\\(U_i\\)</span> 展开为柱并，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 收集所有包含在某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_i\">\\(U_i\\)</span> 中的柱前缀。若没有有限子覆盖，树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\{\\tau:\\neg\\exists\\sigma\\in S\\ (\\sigma\\preceq\\tau)\\}\">\\(T=\\{\\tau:\\neg\\exists\\sigma\\in S\\ (\\sigma\\preceq\\tau)\\}\\)</span> 每层非空：空的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 层会给至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^n\">\\(2^n\\)</span> 个柱的有限覆盖。König 引理给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in[T]\">\\(X\\in[T]\\)</span>，但覆盖中某个包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的开集有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in S\">\\(\\sigma\\in S\\)</span>，矛盾。有限柱覆盖逐个选取对应的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 就给所需有限索引集。</p>\n<p>对闭子集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>，把开补集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\\setminus C\">\\(2^\\omega\\setminus C\\)</span> 加到原覆盖，得到全空间覆盖，再删除该额外开集的索引。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\varnothing\">\\(C=\\varnothing\\)</span> 时可取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=\\varnothing\">\\(F=\\varnothing\\)</span>。嵌套非空闭集若交空，其开补集构成覆盖；有限子覆盖由嵌套性化为某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_n=\\varnothing\">\\(C_n=\\varnothing\\)</span>，矛盾。所有树均为一般集合树，无有效性假设。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 8.3.1；印刷 168 / PDF 201。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-cantor-space","status":"resolved","id":"ef101d71722ee067","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-cantor-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-closed-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-konig","status":"resolved","id":"b4c1ab1358773e54","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-konig]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-space","status":"resolved","id":"ef101d71722ee067","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cantor-space]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cantor-space]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-konig","status":"resolved","id":"b4c1ab1358773e54","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cantor-space]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"(U_i)_{i\\in I}","display":false},{"tex":"(C_n)_{n\\in\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nC\\subseteq\\bigcup_{i\\in I}U_i\\Rightarrow\n\\exists F\\subseteq I\\ [|F|<\\omega\\land C\\subseteq\\bigcup_{i\\in F}U_i],\\\\\n(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ C_{n+1}\\subseteq C_n)\\land\n(\\forall n\\ C_n\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\operatorname{Closed}(C_n))\n\\Rightarrow\\bigcap_nC_n\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"U_i","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"U_i","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\{\\tau:\\neg\\exists\\sigma\\in S\\ (\\sigma\\preceq\\tau)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"2^n","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in[T]","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in S","disp